From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Doe <john.doe@somewhere.on.planet>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] JM10 boot-from-external: boot order USB -> SATA -> SD -> eMMC

Part of the optional JM10_BOOT_EXTERNAL mode: keep a full OS on an
external USB2 / mSATA disk and boot it from an eMMC that carries only
the bootloader. Apply together with the sibling boot-ext patches.

Signed-off-by: John Doe <john.doe@somewhere.on.planet>
---
 include/configs/rockchip-common.h | 2 +
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/configs/rockchip-common.h b/include/configs/rockchip-common.h
index e1c4779bc7f1..e1c4779bc7f1 100644
--- a/include/configs/rockchip-common.h
+++ b/include/configs/rockchip-common.h
@@ -120,10 +120,10 @@
 
 #define BOOT_TARGET_DEVICES(func) \
 	BOOT_TARGET_USB(func) \
+	BOOT_TARGET_SCSI(func) \
 	BOOT_TARGET_SD(func) \
+	BOOT_TARGET_EMMC(func) \
 	BOOT_TARGET_NVME(func) \
-	BOOT_TARGET_SCSI(func) \
-	BOOT_TARGET_EMMC(func) \
 	BOOT_TARGET_MTD(func) \
 	BOOT_TARGET_RKNAND(func) \
 	BOOT_TARGET_PXE(func) \
-- 
